							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Yo so this isnt just a shamless plug for Obese&#039;s upcoming events.. I&#039;d like to strongly encourage everyone to post all of their upcoming events on this thread regularly and I will put them on the Obese website... keep me updated folks!<br /><br />Show Updates:<br />** <b>RAHZEL &amp; SUPERNAT</b>&nbsp; cancelled their show here because aparently the tour isnt going so well for them. Thats kind of messed up if you ask me that folks arent showing up to support hip-hop Legends. Then again they should put out new material?<br /><br />** <b>PHAROAHE MONCH</b> has cancelled his tour AGAIN. This is beginning to feel like an abusive relationship... I don&#039;t know how much more I can take of this cruel game.&nbsp; How is it that my two fav emcees of all time are the most flakey and undependable? *cough* mf doom *cough*<br /><br />Anyway here is what we have coming up:<br /><br />10.02 Tuesday <br />Neumos and Obese Present <br />Red Gone Wild tour with<br /><b>REDMAN</b><br />w/ Special Guests<br />Kids in the Hall<br />Akir<br />&#036;18 adv // 8pm // All Ages/Bar W/ID<br />At Neumos<br /><br />10.06 Saturday Nectar &amp; Obese Productions Present<br /><b>PIGEON JOHN</b><br />Tulsi (Cd Release Party)<br />Ohmega Watts<br />Specs One<br />The Elefaders<br />&#036;10 adv.<br />9pm doors<br />21 &amp; Over<br />A Portion of the Proceeds to Benefit <a href="http&#58;//www.BandsWithoutBorders.org" target="_blank">www.BandsWithoutBorders.org</a><br /><br />10.11 Thursday<br />Nectar Lounge &amp; Obese Productions Presents<br />The Soundcatcher Tour<br /><b>DJ VADIM<br />ABSTRACT RUDE</b><br />Yarah Bravo<br />Gabriel Teodros<br />Dj Colin<br />&#036;10 Adv. // 8pm // 21+ w/ID<br />At The Nectar Lounge<br /><br />10.28 Sunday <br />Wake Up and Obese Present<br /><b>AESOP ROCK</b> <br />feat. Rob Sonic <br />and DJ Big Wiz<br />Black Moth Super Rainbow<br />Blockhead w/ Signify<br />&#036;18.50 adv. // 8pm // All Ages/Bar W/ID<br />At The Showbox<br /><br />11.03 Saturday<br />Neumos, Chop Suey and Obese Present<br />Get Back to Music Tour w/<br /><b>LITTLE BROTHER</b><br />w/ Special Guests<br />&#036;13 Adv // 8pm // All Ages + Bar<br />At Chop Suey<br /><br />11.04 Sunday <br />Wake Up and Obese Present<br />Hip-Hop Live! The Greatest Hip-Hop Tour of the Year! <br /><b>RAKIM (Eric B. &amp; Rakim)<br />GHOSTFACE (Wu Tang Clan)<br />Brother Ali </b><br />Backed by the 10 Piece Rhythm Roots Allstars<br />Dj Scene<br />&#036;32 adv. // 8pm // All Ages/Bar W/ID<br />At The Showbox<br />&nbsp;<br />11.09 Friday<br />Obese &amp; Wake Up Presents<br /><b>DEL THE FUNKY HOMOSAPIEN<br />DEVIN THE DUDE</b><br />Bukue One<br />Serendipity Project<br />&#036;20 adv. // 8pm // All Ages - Bar w/ ID<br />At Showbox<br /><br />11.29 Thursday<br />Neumos &amp; Obese Present<br /><b>BUCK 65</b><br />w/ Special Guests<br />&#036;12 adv. // 8pm // 21+<br />At The Crocodile<br /><br />12.11 Tuesday<br />Obese Productions Presents<br /><b>EYEDEA &amp; ABILITIES</b><br />w/ Special Guests<br />&#036;12 adv. // 8pm // All Ages + Bar<br />At Chop Suey<br /><br /><a href="http&#58;//www.ObeseProductions.com" target="_blank">www.ObeseProductions.com</a></div>
