							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;"><i>repost</i>:<br /><b>OBESE PRODUCTIONS IS RETIRING FROM THE GAME!</b><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><b>SYKE!</b> We&#039;re not going anywhere... you wish though. Haters.<br /><br /><b>IN OTHER NEWS...</b><br />Some would say that next week is over-saturated with dope Hip-Hop shows..<br />I mean.. how could you possibly chose between them all? <br />WELL NOW YOU DONT HAVE TOO FOLKS! <br />You might as well take the entire week off of work &amp; school because..<br /><br /><b>Nectar, Obese Productions, Wonder If You Care?, and PUSH</b> have gotten together to offer discounted 3-Day Passes to all 3 shows for only one low price!<br /><br />10.09 Tuesday <br />Wonder If You Care? Presents A Hip-Hop Showcase to Benefit Breast Cancer Research w/<br />NEEMA of UNEXPECTED ARRIVAL<br />Grynch<br />D. Black<br />Jay Barz<br />Positive ID<br />Anomilie<br />Terry Radjaw<br />Kublakai<br />Type<br />Black Senate<br />The Parker Brothaz<br />Hosted by Joseph Average<br />with DJ Money D<br />&nbsp;&#036;7<br />9pm door<br />21 &amp; Over<br /><br />10.10 <br />PUSH and New Jack Hustlers Present A Benefit for N/NW<br />GRAFFITI ROCK with<br />Dyme Def<br />Dimmak<br />Graves<br />Bedroom Stompers<br />Phil in the Blank<br />Neezie Pleaze<br />N/NW<br />&#036;5 cover with proceeds going to N/NW<br />8pm Doors<br />21 &amp; Over<br />&nbsp;<br />10.11 Thursday <br />Nectar &amp; Obese Productions Present The Soundcatcher Tour with<br />DJ VADIM<br />ABSTRACT RUDE<br />Yarah Bravo<br />Gabriel Teodros<br />DJ Colin<br />&#036;10 Adv.<br />8pm doors<br />21 &amp; Over<br /><br />A Limited Number of 3-Day Passes are available exclusively online at:<br /><a href="http&#58;//www.BrownPaperTickets.com/event/22249" target="_blank">http://www.BrownPaperTickets.com/event/22249</a><br /><b>FOR ONLY &#036;12 !!!!</b><br /><br /><i>The discounted passes (will call list) will give the ticketholder access to each of the three 21 &amp; over events...&nbsp; </i><br /><br />NOW YOU DONT HAVE TO CHOSE!<br />What do you think about that?</div>
